From e81b28feeb250b41becd80d9caeac983f96701b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 04:09:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sdk_dpaa: preserve SEC buffer ownership through receive and
 completion

Use page-backed skb pools for SG receive. Retain the permanent SGT mapping and record exact payload ownership, unmapping and releasing completed skbs even when traffic becomes idle. Share completion across reuse, rejected enqueues and bounded reaping.

Signed-off-by: Tomaz Zaman <tomaz@mono.si>
